ent-WGEnvSac = flesh sac
    .desc = A wet sac stuck to the deck. It swells and sinks like it is breathing.
ent-WGEnvSacBig = flesh sac
    .desc = A fat, wet sac stuck to the deck. It swells and sinks like it is breathing.
ent-WGEnvSacSmall = small flesh sac
    .desc = A fist-sized sac stuck to the deck. It twitches.
ent-WGEnvSacBeating = beating sac
    .desc = A fat sac with a slow heartbeat in it. Stand close and you can hear it.
ent-WGEnvOrgans = heap of organs
    .desc = Wet organs heaped on the deck and growing into it. Some of them are still working.
ent-WGEnvOrgansB = heap of organs
    .desc = Wet organs heaped on the deck and growing into it. Some of them are still working.
ent-WGEnvOrgansC = heap of organs
    .desc = Wet organs heaped on the deck and growing into it. Some of them are still working.
ent-WGEnvSpur = bone spurs
    .desc = Pale spikes of bone pushing up through the flesh.
ent-WGEnvSpurTall = bone spurs
    .desc = Pale spikes of bone pushing up through the flesh.
ent-WGEnvSpurLow = bone spurs
    .desc = Pale spikes of bone pushing up through the flesh.
ent-WGEnvTendril = tendrils
    .desc = Thin roots of grey flesh crawling across the deck.
ent-WGEnvTendrilB = tendrils
    .desc = Thin roots of grey flesh crawling across the deck.
ent-WGEnvTendrilC = tendrils
    .desc = Thin roots of grey flesh crawling across the deck.
ent-WGEnvGore = gore
    .desc = A lot of someone, spread thin.
ent-WGEnvGoreSmear = gore
    .desc = Dragged across the floor and left to dry.
ent-WGEnvGoreSpray = gore
    .desc = Sprayed up the wall and run down.
ent-WGEnvGoreScraps = gore
    .desc = Scraps of someone. It is hard to say which part.
ent-WGEnvGoreTrail = gore
    .desc = A wet trail of gore.
ent-WGEnvRemains = remains
    .desc = Picked clean. Whatever did it was thorough.
ent-WGEnvOoze = ooze
    .desc = Sour green slime. It smells like a rotten fridge.
ent-WGEnvDrip = dripping ooze
    .desc = Something wet keeps falling from above, one slow drop at a time.
ent-WGEnvWeb = veins
    .desc = Thin red veins grown across it. They throb.
ent-WGEnvWebB = veins
    .desc = Thin red veins grown across it. They throb.
ent-WGEnvWebC = veins
    .desc = Thin red veins grown across it. They throb.
ent-WGEnvScreen = corrupted screen
    .desc = The screen is full of strange writing. It flickers when you look at it.
ent-WGEnvScreenB = corrupted screen
    .desc = The screen is full of strange writing. It flickers when you look at it.
ent-WGEnvHaze = sour mist
    .desc = A thin haze that smells of copper and rot.
ent-WGEnvHazeB = sour mist
    .desc = A thin haze that smells of copper and rot.
ent-WGEnvCocoon = fused remains
    .desc = Someone's body, grown into the wall. You would rather not look for a face.
ent-WGEnvCocoonB = fused remains
    .desc = Someone's body, grown into the wall. You would rather not look for a face.

wg-remade-morgue-knock = Something knocks from inside the {$tray}.
wg-remade-morgue-burst = The {$tray} bursts open!
wg-remade-closet-torn = Something tears the {$locker} open!
wg-remade-vent-burst = Something tears out of the vent!
wg-remade-vent-tell = The vent rattles. Something is in it.
wg-remade-guard-cry = The Monolith screams. Everything near it turns.
